flowchart LR
  SRC[(Source repo<br/>parasol-claims)] --> BUILD
  subgraph PIPE["Supply-chain pipeline (in your-name-cicd namespace)"]
    direction TB
    BUILD[build-image<br/>buildah] --> SBOMT[SBOM report<br/>CycloneDX]
    BUILD --> SCAN{scan gate<br/>RHACS}
  end
  BUILD -. Tekton Chains signs .-> SIG[[signature + SLSA provenance<br/>stored beside the image]]
  SCAN -->|clean| REG[(image + .sig + .att<br/>in the registry)]
  SCAN -->|CVE found| STOP[/build fails —<br/>image never ships/]
  SIG --> REG
  REG --> ADM{ImagePolicy<br/>admission}
  ADM -->|signed| RUN([pod runs])
  ADM -->|unsigned| DENY[/pull refused/]
  classDef g fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#137333,color:#0d652d;
  classDef r fill:#fce8e6,stroke:#c5221f,color:#a50e0e;
  class REG,RUN,SIG g;
  class STOP,DENY r;
